 route but to the chilling truth behind this nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The school hasn't just changed its structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doorways are missing, hallways spontaneously seal her path, and the corridor repeats in an endless loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this place that seems to be alive, she may ultimately have to confront the school itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>May your \u2018Way Back Home\u2019 be a safe one.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Studio Incomplete Combustion"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080460/43b9c0f27b62ae6c0415659b88f14810c01443f8/header.jpg?t=1770195847","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4080460/1684425944/555a74874754d6a17e03e8021373b97d014a68dc/1769432579/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769433359","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4080460/1684425944/555a74874754d6a17e03e8021373b97d014a68dc/1769432579/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769433359","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4080460/1684425944/555a74874754d6a17e03e8021373b97d014a68dc/1769432579/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769433359","id":257229443,"name":"Hagyo-gil: The Way Home Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257229443/b53325162cb6a14de08fa9399d0a2d1527e5ec8d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769433359"}],"name":"Hagyo-gil: The Way Home","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-6700K | AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae GTX 1070 Ti or AMD Rad